# ============================================================
#  CLASSES TO MONITOR
# ============================================================
#
#  Add one class per line. Three formats are supported:
#
#  1. SECTION CODE ONLY — just the 5-digit code:
#       34210
#
#  2. CLASS INFO ONLY — dept, course number, instructor:
#       COMPSCI . . . . Computer Science, 164, eppstein
#       Watches ALL sections under that class automatically.
#
#  3. FULL — section code + class details (recommended):
#       34210, COMPSCI . . . . Computer Science, 164, eppstein
#       ^^^^^^  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^  ^^^  ^^^^^^^^
#       |       dept (copy exactly from WebSOC)  |    instructor last name
#       section code                             course number
#       Validates at startup that the section code matches the class.
#
#  Lines that start with # are ignored (like this one).
#  You can mix formats and add as many classes as you want.
# ============================================================

# Example 1: section code only
34210

# Example 2: class info only (watches all sections)
COMPSCI . . . . Computer Science, 164, eppstein

# Example 3: full (with startup validation)
34210, COMPSCI . . . . Computer Science, 164, eppstein
